{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/azizi-royal-bay-palm-jumeirah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":703,"crm_id":"25","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Royal Bay","slug":"azizi-royal-bay-palm-jumeirah","display_address":"Palm Jumeirah","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":3334830,"display_price":"3.33M","lattitude":25.1254854,"longitude":55.149587,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"Royal Bay is an exciting residential project from the prestigious developer Azizi Developments. Located on the shores of the Persian Gulf in the Palm Jumeirah area, this project embodies the perfect combination of luxury and sophistication.<p>The Royal Bay Complex is an elegant luxury apartment complex with stunning sea views. The modern and stylish design of the buildings emphasizes the superiority of the project, and the panoramic windows give the apartments an impressive atmosphere.<p>The apartments in Royal Bay are diverse and spacious, providing various planning solutions to meet the needs of each resident. Each house is equipped with the most modern amenities and high-quality materials, which creates an atmosphere of comfort and luxury.<p>Royal Bay residents can enjoy first-class amenities including pools with endless sea views, a fitness center with state-of-the-art equipment, a luxurious spa, spacious relaxation and barbecue areas, and a private beach for residents.<p>Royal Bay is located in the Palm Jumeirah area, a central area with easy access to many transport interchanges. Dubai Mall is a 30-minute drive away, and Burj Al Arab and The Walk JBR are a 25-minute drive away. Dubai International Airport is also about a 40-minute drive away, and the Al Maktoum International Airport is 50 minutes away.","tile_image":